OL,3,GNEWSAWoman strangled before man's
OL,4,Adeath, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 52-year-old woman who was found dead
OL,7,Fat an address in Keighley was
OL,8,Fstrangled, an inquest opening has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FOffice administrator Joanne Whitham was
OL,12,Ffound unresponsive by police and
OL,13,Fparamedics at the home she shared with
OL,14,Fher partner on New Stead Rise in the
OL,15,FRiddlesden area at 18:55 BST on 11
OL,16,FAugust, Bradford Coroner's Court was
OL,17,Ftold.
OL,19,FMeanwhile, a 59-year-old man whose
OL,20,Fdeath police said was linked to
OL,21,FWhitham's, was identified by the same
OL,22,Fcourt as Kevin Moore.
