OL,5,
OL,6,FA separate inquest opening into Moore's
OL,7,Fdeath heard he was found at his
OL,8,Fbusiness premises seven miles away, on
OL,9,FTong Industrial Estate in Baildon,
OL,10,Flater the same day.
